OL,4,B'I'm very healthy' - Kompany to return 
OL,5,Bto dugout after health scare           
OL,6,GBayern Munich boss Vincent Kompany     
OL,7,Gsays he is "very healthy" and grateful 
OL,8,Gfor all of the support he has received 
OL,9,Gas he prepares to return to the dugout 
OL,10,Gon Friday.                             
OL,12,FThe 40-year-old former Manchester City 
OL,13,Fcaptain was taken to hospital after    
OL,14,Ffalling ill while watching the club's  
OL,15,Fsecond team train last month.          
OL,17,FKompany was diagnosed with meningeal   
OL,18,Firritation - an inflammation of the    
OL,19,Fprotective membrane surrounding the    
OL,20,Fbrain and spinal cord.                 
